{"ideviceId":"2026050118220185828Z","textInfoDurationInput":"","textInfoDurationTextInput":"Duración","textInfoParticipantsInput":"","textInfoParticipantsTextInput":"Agrupamiento","textTextarea":"<p>Si lo que quieres es ver cómo se resuelve un sistema en concreto, usa esta herramienta.</p>
<div id="gauss-solver" style="font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; max-width: 950px; margin: auto; border: 2px solid #0056b3; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);"><!-- Cabecera -->
<div style="background: #0056b3; color: white; padding: 15px; text-align: center;">
<h2 style="margin: 0; text-shadow: 1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);">Solucionador Paso a Paso: Método de Gauss</h2>
</div>
<!-- Panel de Control -->
<div style="padding: 15px 20px; background: #f0f7ff; border-bottom: 1px solid #cce0ff; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px; justify-content: center; align-items: center;">
<div style="display: flex; gap: 15px; align-items: center;"><label style="font-weight: bold; color: #0056b3;">Dimensión del Sistema:</label><select id="gs-dim" onchange="gsBuildInputGrid()" style="padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid #0056b3; font-weight: bold; color: #0056b3; outline: none;">
<option value="3" selected="selected">3 Ecuaciones (3x3)</option>
<option value="4">4 Ecuaciones (4x4)</option>
</select></div>
<div><button onclick="gsClear()" class="gs-btn-sec">Limpiar Todo</button> <button onclick="gsSolve()" class="gs-btn-main">Resolver Paso a Paso</button></div>
</div>
<div style="padding: 25px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;"><!-- Área de Entrada de Datos -->
<div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 10px; width: 100%;">
<h4 style="color: #0056b3; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 5px;">Introduce los coeficientes:</h4>
<p style="color: #666; font-size: 0.9em; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 15px;"><i>Puedes usar números enteros, decimales o fracciones (ej. 1/2, -3/4). Pon un 0 si falta la incógnita.</i></p>
<div id="gs-input-container" style="display: inline-block; background: #fdfdff; padding: 25px 30px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #e6e6ff;"><!-- Rejilla generada por JS --></div>
</div>
<!-- Contenedor de la Solución -->
<div id="gs-solution-area" style="width: 100%; display: none; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; margin-top: 20px;"><hr style="width: 100%; border: 0; border-top: 2px dashed #cce0ff; margin-bottom: 30px;" />
<h3 style="color: #0056b3; margin-top: 0; text-align: center; width: 100%;">Resolución Detallada</h3>
<div id="gs-steps-container" style="width: 100%;"><!-- Pasos inyectados por JS --></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<style>
    div#gauss-solver .gs-input-val { width: 45px; padding: 6px; text-align: center; border: 1px solid #aaa; border-radius: 4px; font-family: monospace; font-size: 1.1em; transition: border-color 0.2s; }
    div#gauss-solver .gs-input-val:focus { outline: none !important; border-color: #0056b3 !important; background-color: #e6f2ff !important; box-shadow: 0 0 5px rgba(0,86,179,0.2) !important; }
    div#gauss-solver .gs-var-label { font-weight: bold; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 1.2em; font-style: italic; color: #444; margin: 0 5px; }

    div#gauss-solver .gs-step-box { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #cce0ff; border-left: 5px solid #0056b3; border-radius: 6px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
    div#gauss-solver .gs-step-title { font-weight: bold; color: #0056b3; margin-bottom: 15px; font-size: 1.1em; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 8px; }

    div#gauss-solver .gs-matrix-view { display: inline-grid; position: relative; padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 1.1em; font-family: monospace; background: #fdfdff; align-items: center; justify-items: center; border-radius: 4px; margin: 10px 0; }
    div#gauss-solver .gs-matrix-view::before { content: ""; position: absolute; top: 0px; bottom: 0px; left: 0; width: 8px; border: 2px solid #333; border-right: none; border-radius: 4px 0 0 4px; }
    div#gauss-solver .gs-matrix-view::after { content: ""; position: absolute; top: 0px; bottom: 0px; right: 0; width: 8px; border: 2px solid #333; border-left: none; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0; }

    div#gauss-solver .frac-css { display: inline-block; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 0.95em; margin: 0 2px; }
    div#gauss-solver .frac-css span { display: block; padding: 0.1em 0.3em; line-height: 1.1; }
    div#gauss-solver .frac-css span.fdn { border-top: 1px solid #333; }

    /* BOTONES PRINCIPALES (Blindaje contra eXeLearning) */

    /* Botón Limpiar (Fantasma Gris) */
    div#gauss-solver button.gs-btn-sec {
        background-color: #ffffff !important;
